      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Qualification gates",
      "items": [
        "Verify PHP/CLI/extensions, Composer builds, per-minute cron, shared locks, private storage, quotas and outbound HTTPS / SMTP TLS.",
        "Provider timeout 90s < job timeout 120s < retry_after 180s; finite worker must finish one whole job. Verify extraction utilities and process limits."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Failure decision",
      "items": [
        "Unsupported runtime or utilities → move the whole application to Proxmox. No assumed hybrid worker dependency.",
        "Prebuild assets. No Docker, Redis, root access, Node server or local identity service required."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Environment and operations",
      "items": [
        "Separate test DB, credentials, files, endpoints and SMTP sink. Synthetic data never enters production reports/export/mail.",
